# No video walkthroughs

Do not record screen videos, browser walkthrough recordings, or demo videos of neighborhood or service-area pages.

Verify by fetching the local routes (`curl` / HTTP 200) and checking the HTML for the H1, canonical, JSON-LD, and the parent city neighborhood link. Optional still screenshots are fine. Video is not.
